        {
          "title": "显卡的包装",
          "content": "<p>现在的显卡包装，都非常简单。比如，下面是5090显卡的包装。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025102102.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025102103.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025102104.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>但是，二十多年前的21世纪初，可不是这样，显卡的包装非常花哨。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025102105.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025102106.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025102107.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>究其原因，一方面是环保观念的提升，另一方面是显卡现在几乎没有竞争，一上架就会被买走，厂商就不在包装上动脑筋了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025102108.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202510/bg2025102109.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
